{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_03",
  "title": "7:22P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5da63fdbad5fcbf5a561e0fa2ca097e2484f19226b296b9eec242928992a50c1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呼啊——都这个点了......赶紧回去睡觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "唔，如果在这里开个海鲜摊，这客流量可真不得了啊。唔？那是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "喂~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "休想得逞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "是我，是我啊，放手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "什么嘛，你怎么在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......收摊回家的路上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "倒是你在这里发呆——不对，立刻就能反手擒拿好像也不算在发呆......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你听说刚才在立交桥上发生的车祸了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......你不是应该在复习功课吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "劳逸结合，不然明天拿到试卷的时候脑袋一白就完蛋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "欸，好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "刚才好像听客人提到过，但愿没有伤亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "嗯......但我在事务所听说，这事儿和一群不干不净的家伙有关系......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "先说好，我绝对和什么杀手、帮派之类的没有关系，你知道的对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你的事情大家早就清楚了——不如说你总是这幅态度，不被怀疑才奇怪吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......是喔，难怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "而且两个小时前还在龙门边郊的高速公路上发生了一起瓦斯爆炸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "高速公路上，瓦斯爆炸？这个理由也太滥用了点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "呃。你该不会想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "我说了嘛，劳逸结合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "......哈，就知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "text": "但这算劳还是逸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "差不多了吧，再怎么说这里也是市中心，他们不可能行动自如。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "你刚才点的是抹茶味的？那这份是你的，我请客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "的确没看见什么可疑的家伙，可......我们是不是太悠闲了点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "什么话，这可是五星推荐，比黑手党厉害多了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "你能联系得到德克萨斯他们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不能，事出突然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "既然这样，那就更不着急了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "你的冰淇淋要化了喔，别这么紧张兮兮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊，我只是......谁能料到事情会变成现在这样。我是应该冷静一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "黑手党们千里迢迢从叙拉古来到龙门，总不会只是为了参加安魂节狂欢吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......他们有别的目的，其中之一，是我。但是更具体的，我还不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "敌明我暗，既然已经摆脱了追击，应该利用单独行动的优势调查事态的因果......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "可我们该怎么入手？应该找机会进行反追踪吗？不，还是应该优先和德克萨斯小姐取得联系......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "呵呵，比起德克萨斯他们，你倒是更像个普通的信使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，突然就开始自说自话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "不，你说的没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "既然我们都知道黑手党另有目的，的确不该轻举妄动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "只是偶尔也要相信一下德克萨斯她们，别看他们总是那样，企鹅物流可是很强的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "虽然用“强”来形容一个物流公司有点奇怪，嗯......算啦，反正我也没资格抱怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "也许我们一边逛街，一边看看风景，等见到德克萨斯的时候，他们已经把敌人一网打尽了喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......是，是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "看见那家糖果店了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "与其说店，更像一个摊铺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯，有些年头了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "很多年前我刚来龙门的时候就来过这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "那个时候呀......身上也没有龙门币，说实话，灰头土脸的，倒是一眼就被糖果吸引了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "是......这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "只是单纯的长途跋涉，路上遇到了一点小麻烦。信使都是这样吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "走，我们去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "哇！是彩色的星星！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "爷爷，你为什么能把星星摘下来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "这就是秘密了，可不能随随便便告诉你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "text": "这哪里是星星，不就是加了色素的水果糖嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "哎，可是这么好看的糖果真的很少见诶......你不想要吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "text": "啰、啰嗦！喂！有棉花糖吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "有，怎么没有，来，伸手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "诶——但比起这点棉花糖，我还是想要那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "text": "我讨厌吃水果糖！太甜了！而且舌头会变成奇怪的颜色！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "想要的话就一并拿去吧，难得的安魂夜，就不收你们钱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "这么晚了，赶紧回家睡觉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "谢谢爷爷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小男孩",
      "text": "别鞠躬啦！快去那边的玩具店看看！安魂夜限定骑士哎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "现在的孩子们真有活力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "你们也要买点什么吗？维多利亚进口的水果软糖，附赠安魂夜蜡烛装饰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "不着急，老先生。长夜漫漫，今晚才刚刚开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "啊啊，说的也是。你们这样的年轻人，一定会去参加闹市狂欢的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（莫斯提马小姐，这位是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "......老先生也会参加今晚的活动吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "怎么可能呢，我已经是把老骨头了，但我的糖果会代替我参加的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "今年的狂欢盛典很特别吗？似乎还有一些外宾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "这座城市在先前的岁月里沉寂太久了，人们的确需要一个像样的狂欢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "既然是狂欢，有更多的客人参与进来，发生各种各样的事情，不是也很有趣吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "的确，是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "安魂夜本来就是为了送走那些亡魂，活着的人能够开开心心，就是最好的祭奠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "真的不买点什么吗？当年你可是在橱窗外头看入神了的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "原来你还记得，真有点不好意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "哈哈，怎么记不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "可是很遗憾，工作之前吃太多甜食可不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "是吗......那一路走好，年轻人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "别忘了有空回来看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯，会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "狂欢吗，号称是龙门这么多年来最盛大的一次节日活动呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "......拜松？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "对不起，我在想事情......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "在这种情况下，你会想到什么显而易见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "但是你太喜欢思考了，偶尔也要以直觉行事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "直觉......莫斯提马小姐这样的信使，也会相信直觉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "更确切地来说，是随机应变吧。比如，我们现在正站在桥上，而下面有通行的小货船。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "然后，前后各有三名乔装打扮好的黑手党成员，正在慢慢向我们靠近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "想伪装已经迟了，他们早就盯上我们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "从刚才的糖果铺那里开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我、我们被包围了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "这附近都是游客，我们不能在这里大打出手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "但是很遗憾，对方似乎没有这种顾虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......现在怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "跳下去，现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "从桥上——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "所以说你太喜欢思考了，跳过栅栏，纵身一跃，就这样——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等、等一下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "噗哈！总觉得今天不是第一次自由落体......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "这是......糖果？为什么要用船运糖果？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "但我们总算甩开他们了，莫斯提马——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
